text WorldTournamentYoungster_Text{
    "Someday, I'll be a famous guy!\p"
    "But for now, I'm just a spectator\n"
    "here."
}
text WorldTournamentGentleman_Text{
    "The Pokémon World Tournament\n"
    "attracts big names as well.\p"
    "I'm pretty sure I saw Aaron,\n"
    "the Gym Leader of Coralgrove City\l"
    "waltz in not too long ago."
}
text WorldTournamentAceTrainer_Text{
    "It's the Pokémon World Tournament!\n"
    "It's all in the name!\p"
    "Trainers have gathered\n"
    "from all over the world!"
}
text WorldTournamentScientist_Text{
    "The crowd will go wild for\n"
    "my Pokémon!"
}
text WorldTournamentHiker_Text{
    "Many trainers from far away\n"
    "will come to participate!"
}
text WorldTournamentMan5_Text{
    "I'm not much of a trainer myself,\n"
    "but my brother has come real close\l"
    "to winning in the past.\p"
    "If we cheer loud enough,\n"
    "he'll definitely win this time!"
}
text WorldTournamentGirl3_Text{
    "The competition is really fierce\n"
    "this time around.\p"
    "I can't wait to see who wins!"
}
text WorldTournamentLeftBouncer_Text{
    "That's the Pokemon World Tournament\n"
    "for you! It's packed with spectators!"
}
text WorldTournamentRightBouncer_Text{
    "It's crazy popular! This is what\n"
    "packed to the rafters means!"
}